// Category: redeclarations of builtin-owned names.
//
// `functions: fst/1` BEFORE `builtins: dest-pairing`: the builtin's arm
// check exempts the projection, so the later builtin turns it into the
// destructor the echo prints.  sig_redecl_dest_pairing_after is the other
// order.  No corpus theory redeclares a projection.

theory SigRedeclDestPairing
begin

functions: fst/1

builtins: dest-pairing

end
